Upstream work
-------------
This project is a local adaptation layer around linkedin_scraper:

  linkedin_scraper
  Copyright (C) Joeyism and linkedin_scraper contributors
  https://github.com/joeyism/linkedin_scraper

The exact upstream source revision is
b1cdc1c0e85bee8764d62565d229c682e5eb81bb. The upstream package is not copied
into this repository; uv obtains that revision as source and builds it.

Structured Voyager profile parsing uses:

  linkedin-cli
  Copyright (C) eracle and linkedin-cli contributors
  https://github.com/darwincr/linkedin-cli

The exact revision is 004e06a002ecf79c8ca1161c1e1d12487329bc90 and is
distributed under the MIT License.

Modifications/adaptations in this project include:
* persistent Playwright Chromium user-data-directory lifecycle;
* personal recent-activity collection using the upstream company post parser;
* preview-only mutual-connection parsing and an ExtendedPerson model;
* durable SQLite queue/archive, safety limits, CLI, and Monica export.

These adaptation files are also distributed under GPL-3.0-only. No affiliation
with or endorsement by LinkedIn is claimed.
